WEBVTT

00:03.120 --> 00:07.490
We have worked almost every day
for a week since we started this work...

00:07.830 --> 00:10.480
L-Lilysa, could it be...

00:10.480 --> 00:14.390
I still need to burn the photos to DVDs,

00:14.390 --> 00:16.700
but it's almost done!

00:17.090 --> 00:18.920
It's all thanks to you, Senior!

00:19.250 --> 00:21.130
You've given it your all, too.

00:47.360 --> 00:54.450
2.5 DIMENSIONAL SEDUCTION

01:54.010 --> 01:59.020
#4 LET'S GO, THE FIRST EVENT!

01:59.380 --> 02:00.900
An event? Tomorrow?

02:00.900 --> 02:02.850
You and Senior pulled an all-nighter?!

02:02.850 --> 02:05.340
There's so much information!
I can't even take it!

02:05.340 --> 02:07.970
Would you like to come with us, Mikari?

02:07.970 --> 02:10.930
There's no way I can go
to such a crowd!

02:10.930 --> 02:11.430
Ah...

02:11.430 --> 02:13.740
I mean, nothing happened, right?!

02:13.740 --> 02:14.990
"Nothing happened"?

02:14.990 --> 02:16.370
Between you and Senior!

02:20.310 --> 02:24.010
Hey, Lilysa, let me ask you one thing...

02:24.900 --> 02:27.460
What do you think of Senior?

02:31.430 --> 02:34.020
Going to the event with Lilysa...

02:34.020 --> 02:37.070
This is...

02:37.910 --> 02:40.260
Isn't this subtly date-like?

02:40.260 --> 02:43.280
No, wait! I'm just helping out my junior!

02:43.280 --> 02:45.230
Or rather, this is a club activity!

02:45.230 --> 02:47.310
It's like going to a sports meet!

02:48.130 --> 02:50.720
Wait, what am I going to wear?
I don't have any clothes!

02:50.720 --> 02:51.570
What should I do?!

02:51.570 --> 02:53.030
This is not a date!

02:53.030 --> 02:57.490
Calm down! It's not like Lilysa is
worrying about what to wear too!

02:59.150 --> 03:00.950
About Senior?

03:00.950 --> 03:03.150
Yes. What do you think of him?

03:03.150 --> 03:06.170
Umm... He has the same interests as me,

03:06.560 --> 03:08.910
he supports my dreams,

03:08.910 --> 03:11.880
and he is modest but surprisingly reliable.

03:12.370 --> 03:15.530
I know this is like
an otaku-ish thing to say, but...

03:15.530 --> 03:17.840
He's like Master Ashford, isn't he?

03:17.840 --> 03:20.180
So you just mean you like him, right?!

03:20.710 --> 03:21.930
Huh?

03:21.930 --> 03:24.640
Oh, shoot! I just made it more weird!

03:25.160 --> 03:28.400
I... have a feeling for Senior?

03:28.400 --> 03:30.610
No, of course not!

03:30.610 --> 03:34.360
Ah, what should I wear tomorrow?!
I don't have any clothes!

03:34.940 --> 03:37.570
What if I went as Liliel?
Don't be ridiculous!

03:37.570 --> 03:41.580
Why am I suddenly feeling embarrassed?

03:43.390 --> 03:45.760
The event opens at 10:00 a.m.,

03:45.760 --> 03:49.130
but since it's our first event,
let's take the first train just in case.

03:49.130 --> 03:51.930
But it's too early!

03:51.930 --> 03:54.530
What are we going to do for four hours?

03:55.980 --> 03:57.690
My outfit isn't weird, right?

03:57.690 --> 04:00.220
What kind of clothes will Lilysa wear?

04:01.440 --> 04:03.220
Well, I guess something like these...

04:03.570 --> 04:05.180
S-Senior.

04:05.600 --> 04:06.850
Ah, Lily—

04:11.820 --> 04:14.430
S-Sorry for making you wait.

04:15.210 --> 04:17.290
A-Are you Lilysa?

04:17.290 --> 04:19.900
She's wearing trendy outfits?!

04:19.900 --> 04:22.470
Do I look weird?
I knew it didn't suit me!

04:22.470 --> 04:24.780
N-No, you look great!

04:24.780 --> 04:29.000
Lilysa, are you one of those girls
who hide being an otaku?

04:29.000 --> 04:31.210
N-No... This is...

04:31.620 --> 04:35.920
OUTFITS OTAKU LIKE
What should I wear to an event with Senior?

04:35.920 --> 04:37.880
VIRGIN KILLER OUTFITS

04:39.020 --> 04:40.840
Should I get it?
Wait, hell, no!

04:40.840 --> 04:43.770
What? You want me to help you
pick an outfit for tomorrow?

04:43.770 --> 04:47.520
If you don't help me, I might end up
wearing virgin killer outfits!

04:47.520 --> 04:49.060
Killer outfit?

04:49.790 --> 04:52.000
Where do you live?

04:52.590 --> 04:54.380
Pretty close to you, I see.

04:54.380 --> 04:57.820
You're really hopeless.
I'll stop by tomorrow morning.

05:00.860 --> 05:04.430
The boat neck and drop shoulders
show off your chest,

05:04.430 --> 05:07.120
while the innerwear will add
a pinch of sexiness.

05:07.120 --> 05:10.040
Wide pants would be fine,
but they are not popular with men,

05:10.040 --> 05:12.000
so wear a mini-skirt with a hanging belt.

05:12.000 --> 05:14.380
Ah, and a purse across your shoulder.

05:14.380 --> 05:17.610
Even though it's May, it's hot today,
so sandals are not allowed.

05:17.610 --> 05:18.840
You must wear high heels.

05:18.840 --> 05:20.580
And obviously, wear contacts.

05:20.580 --> 05:22.550
W-What is she talking about?

05:22.550 --> 05:24.450
Well, this will do.

05:24.450 --> 05:26.750
I'm sorry for asking you
this early in the morning.

05:26.750 --> 05:28.390
Seriously...

05:28.880 --> 05:31.830
I'm just returning the favor
for the costume you made me.

05:31.830 --> 05:33.850
We're even now!

05:34.220 --> 05:35.960
Just don't tell Senior, okay?!

05:35.960 --> 05:38.190
Thank you, Mikari.

05:38.860 --> 05:43.930
And I'm sorry.
We're kind of early, aren't we?

05:43.930 --> 05:47.280
Well, it's good that we're not too rushed.

05:47.280 --> 05:49.540
And we have some time to kill.

05:49.540 --> 05:51.690
Senior is so calm.

05:51.690 --> 05:55.000
I feel so embarrassed because I was
the only one thinking it was a date.

05:55.460 --> 05:59.960
What is it? Did she also think this might
be a date and put in extra effort?!

05:59.960 --> 06:01.470
No, I'm just overthinking it!

06:01.470 --> 06:04.260
We're just two otaku friends
going to an event!

06:04.260 --> 06:07.180
But we totally...

06:07.180 --> 06:09.900
...look like a couple!

06:09.900 --> 06:12.450
She must be nervous
about her first event!

06:12.450 --> 06:14.000
I have to say something...

06:15.110 --> 06:18.820
I have some experience
in the dating game.

06:18.820 --> 06:19.590
WE STILL HAVE THREE HOURS BEFORE THE EVENT;
WHAT DO WE DO?

06:19.590 --> 06:20.450
YOU LOOK CUTE TODAY, LILYSA.
IT'S A BEAUTIFUL DAY TODAY.

06:20.450 --> 06:21.320
WHAT COLOR OF UNDERWEAR
ARE YOU WEARING TODAY?

06:21.910 --> 06:25.040
Good thing it's sunny today.

06:25.040 --> 06:27.680
Let's play it safe and talk
about the weather here.

06:27.680 --> 06:31.210
I didn't make a mistake since
it's the one thing people agree on.

06:31.210 --> 06:32.290
Ah, yes.

06:32.690 --> 06:36.220
Sunny weather means a bunch
of white highlights on your photos.

06:36.220 --> 06:40.170
Cloudy weather is much better
if you're shooting outside.

06:40.170 --> 06:42.170
Hey, are you serious?

06:45.180 --> 06:49.150
How pathetic! As her senior,
I must take the lead here!

06:49.150 --> 06:51.770
Let's kill a little time somewhere, shall we?

06:51.770 --> 06:53.770
Y-You're right!

06:53.930 --> 06:54.610
GAME CLOWN

06:54.610 --> 06:55.870
GAME CLOWN
Still closed.

06:55.870 --> 06:57.950
GAME CLOWN
We came too early.

06:58.670 --> 07:00.610
GAME CLOWN
There's a karaoke place down the street.

07:03.500 --> 07:05.720
Just closed...

07:06.800 --> 07:08.560
She looks disappointed.

07:08.560 --> 07:11.120
This is bad.
I have to make up for it somehow!

07:11.200 --> 07:11.890
MANGA CAFE

07:11.890 --> 07:13.410
MANGA CAFE
It's full...

07:13.410 --> 07:15.360
Let's go to the other side of the station.

07:15.360 --> 07:16.320
We'll find a store—

07:16.320 --> 07:17.980
S-Senior...

07:17.980 --> 07:18.630
Huh?

07:19.330 --> 07:21.590
Sorry, my feet hurt.

07:25.040 --> 07:27.270
Are you okay?
Let me see it.

07:27.270 --> 07:31.560
I'm sorry, I've never walked
so much in heels.

07:32.010 --> 07:34.400
Is this why she looked so miserable?

07:34.400 --> 07:36.710
And I kept dragging her all over.

07:36.710 --> 07:39.150
Why didn't you notice it, you moron!

07:39.600 --> 07:43.360
3D girls are not that easy,
unlike in games.

07:43.920 --> 07:46.820
Oh, what a disaster...

07:52.210 --> 07:54.720
Ah, and now she's started
looking at her phone.

07:54.720 --> 07:59.180
No, I made her look at it.
I have to say something, but...

07:59.180 --> 08:00.430
Senior.

08:01.840 --> 08:03.310
LILIEL SIDE STORY
Do you want to watch

08:03.310 --> 08:04.880
LILIEL SIDE STORY
the missed streaming of Liliel?

08:04.880 --> 08:06.020
LILIEL SIDE STORY
I couldn't watch it yesterday

08:06.020 --> 08:07.090
LILIEL SIDE STORY
because of preparations.

08:07.710 --> 08:08.460
Huh?

08:08.840 --> 08:09.530
STORE

08:09.530 --> 08:13.130
Uwooghh! Liliel!

08:13.130 --> 08:17.440
Best episode ever!
I wish I watched it when it streamed!

08:17.440 --> 08:18.690
I know right?!

08:19.090 --> 08:22.820
But I'm glad I got to see it with you.

08:23.890 --> 08:25.400
S-Sorry...

08:26.860 --> 08:31.660
I mean, I'm not smart enough.
And it ended up like this.

08:32.270 --> 08:34.510
We just watched anime here.

08:36.420 --> 08:37.530
That's true.

08:38.420 --> 08:43.750
When we're together, we always have fun,
no matter where we are.

08:43.750 --> 08:45.330
Well...

08:45.330 --> 08:49.050
If I was a girl like Lilysa,
maybe the 3D girls wouldn't...

08:49.050 --> 08:53.010
No, no! She's just talking about
a good senior-junior relationship!

08:53.010 --> 08:54.640
That's what Lilysa meant!

08:55.260 --> 08:57.900
Right? Lilysa?

08:59.090 --> 09:01.230
Ah! The event's about to start!

09:01.230 --> 09:04.530
Oh, right! Time flies
when you watch anime, huh?

09:05.460 --> 09:08.830
Whoa... Is this the whole venue?

09:08.830 --> 09:10.820
It's surprisingly small.

09:10.820 --> 09:13.370
I thought the venue was comiket-sized.

09:13.870 --> 09:15.080
SHOOTING VENUE

09:15.620 --> 09:18.880
T-This is what a cosplay event looks like.

09:18.880 --> 09:21.670
B-But this one is bigger!

09:23.010 --> 09:24.250
Are you okay?

09:24.250 --> 09:27.840
This is the first time
I've participated in this event.

09:28.470 --> 09:29.810
Umm...

09:30.400 --> 09:32.620
This is our table.

09:33.040 --> 09:34.800
Okay, let's display your cosrom.

09:34.800 --> 09:38.220
Umm... About that...

09:38.220 --> 09:38.900
Huh?

09:38.900 --> 09:42.520
I only focused on cosrom...

09:43.230 --> 09:46.730
And I completely forgot about
the cover and poster.

09:47.820 --> 09:49.940
Can we sell them all?

09:51.740 --> 09:53.660
Our neighbor is amazing.

09:54.350 --> 09:57.330
Beautiful cosrom and poster...

09:57.680 --> 09:59.040
In contrast...

09:59.840 --> 10:02.470
Ours look so plain...

10:02.470 --> 10:04.000
Too boorish...

10:04.390 --> 10:09.130
It is like a DVD that a craftsman
burns one by one.

10:09.130 --> 10:09.670
500 PHOTOS OF LILIEL

10:09.670 --> 10:12.620
500 PHOTOS OF LILIEL
I wrote the title with a magic marker.

10:12.620 --> 10:15.890
500 PHOTOS OF LILIEL
Don't do that! It looks like an awful DVD!

10:16.240 --> 10:18.110
- Oh, Lady Magino!
- Then, how about this?

10:18.110 --> 10:20.770
- Over here! The setup is already completed!
- Just don't!

10:21.770 --> 10:25.730
Hello there, neighbor.
My name is Magino.

10:25.730 --> 10:27.730
Nice to meet you.

10:27.730 --> 10:30.530
Oh, god! It's Lady Foroso!

10:30.530 --> 10:32.610
Ah! Nice to meet you!

10:32.610 --> 10:33.700
H-Hello.

10:34.620 --> 10:38.930
That's a new character from a hit
social game that came out in March.

10:38.930 --> 10:41.160
There's already someone cosplaying her?

10:41.160 --> 10:43.840
And you are?
Huh? What's all this?

10:43.840 --> 10:47.500
Umm... It's my first time
and I forgot many things...

10:47.500 --> 10:49.090
So you're a beginner, huh?

10:49.430 --> 10:51.300
It's my cosplay of Liliel.

10:51.650 --> 10:52.940
Liliel? So old!

10:52.940 --> 10:53.500
Ugh!

10:53.500 --> 10:57.270
Oops, my bad!
The spin-off is still running, isn't it?

10:59.030 --> 11:02.010
You must keep up with
the trend to become popular.

11:02.010 --> 11:04.470
The sales are definitely different.

11:04.470 --> 11:06.720
Don't be so vulgar, Ogino.

11:06.720 --> 11:08.360
O-Okay...

11:08.360 --> 11:11.760
Well, everyone fails at first!

11:11.760 --> 11:13.010
Cosrom sales are a business!

11:13.010 --> 11:15.570
If you work hard and ask for help,
you'll be fine!

11:15.570 --> 11:17.070
Let's do our best, okay?

11:17.600 --> 11:19.680
Are you the photographer?

11:19.680 --> 11:21.790
Huh? Well, yeah...

11:25.630 --> 11:28.430
Lilysa, did you bring your costume?

11:28.430 --> 11:30.610
If Liliel is here,
everyone will notice you

11:30.610 --> 11:31.940
and we can sell them out!

11:31.940 --> 11:33.210
Y-Yeah...

11:33.600 --> 11:36.930
But I was thinking of selling it
without cosplaying for now.

11:36.930 --> 11:38.180
Huh? Why?

11:38.180 --> 11:44.790
I feel so nervous surrounded
by all these pro cosplayers...

11:44.790 --> 11:49.610
I was so afraid, and I feel like
losing my confidence...

11:49.610 --> 11:53.580
I-It's okay! Your Liliel is more cu—

11:54.900 --> 11:58.700
I mean... You make your own costumes...

11:59.360 --> 12:03.160
She looks petrified.
It's because of me...

12:03.730 --> 12:05.370
But this condition...

12:06.060 --> 12:09.580
And now, Harucos 19 is officially open!

12:21.930 --> 12:24.640
Well, not the best out of the gate...

12:25.380 --> 12:30.540
Lilysa is cute, but there's no competing
against all these cosplayers...

12:31.450 --> 12:33.350
Yes, just released!

12:33.350 --> 12:37.700
If you buy the full set,
you'll get a bonus postcard.

12:37.700 --> 12:40.410
I'll take the full set then.

12:40.410 --> 12:41.650
FORORRI
Thank you very much!

12:41.650 --> 12:43.870
FORORRI
The new set with this bonus!

12:45.330 --> 12:49.270
Sorry, just getting our life-size posters.

12:49.270 --> 12:50.920
The cosrom is selling like hotcakes.

12:50.920 --> 12:52.380
Oh, my?

12:52.380 --> 12:54.620
I-It's frustrating!

12:54.620 --> 12:57.090
Lilysa's Liliel is way prettier!

12:57.090 --> 13:00.050
Come on, Liliel, you must raise your voice!

13:00.050 --> 13:01.300
Eh? But...

13:01.300 --> 13:03.650
If your cosrom is plain white
and just keep silent,

13:03.650 --> 13:06.520
no one will know what you're selling.

13:06.520 --> 13:08.230
Ah, welcome!

13:08.790 --> 13:10.990
Call out to strangers?

13:10.990 --> 13:13.690
If I could do that,
I wouldn't be an otaku...

13:15.020 --> 13:16.890
What is this? Cosrom?

13:16.890 --> 13:18.750
A customer!

13:18.750 --> 13:21.610
Are you the cosplayer? So young.

13:21.610 --> 13:23.760
Y-Yes. I cosplay as Liliel.

13:23.760 --> 13:25.450
Liliel?!
Interesting!

13:26.810 --> 13:28.410
Hmm... Let me think.

13:29.340 --> 13:33.880
Huh? Wait...
Selling Lilysa's cosrom means...

13:34.590 --> 13:38.940
That all these people will see
the pictures we took.

13:40.020 --> 13:42.010
That makes me feel sick...

13:42.010 --> 13:44.060
No! What am I thinking?!

13:44.060 --> 13:46.500
Is that Lilysa's purpose from the start?

13:47.180 --> 13:50.140
- Let me think about it. I'll be back.
- Huh? What is this feeling?

13:50.480 --> 13:51.790
He left...

13:51.790 --> 13:53.390
Why am I relieved?

13:53.390 --> 13:56.390
This is bad.
It's like I don't want us to sell any...

13:56.390 --> 13:59.070
That's what I thought...

13:59.070 --> 14:02.110
Why? What's gotten into you, Okumura?!

14:02.480 --> 14:04.030
Is this your cosrom?

14:04.030 --> 14:06.080
Y-Yes. I cosplay Liliel.

14:06.080 --> 14:07.660
Do you show underwear?

14:08.380 --> 14:10.570
No, she doesn't!
It is not erotic at all!

14:10.570 --> 14:11.440
Senior?

14:11.440 --> 14:13.870
Goddamit! What's wrong with me?!

14:14.310 --> 14:18.260
Uhh, it's not an erotic cosplay,
just regular cosplay.

14:18.260 --> 14:19.830
For all ages...

14:19.830 --> 14:21.970
Hmm, I see.

14:21.970 --> 14:23.680
It's a bit expensive then.

14:23.680 --> 14:24.500
Huh?

14:24.500 --> 14:26.630
T-Thanks for stopping by.

14:26.630 --> 14:30.310
Lilysa, are there really no erotic pictures?

14:30.310 --> 14:31.020
Huh?

14:31.500 --> 14:35.540
What do you mean, Senior?
I can't sell erotic photos.

14:35.540 --> 14:37.730
I'm still not 18 years old.

14:37.730 --> 14:39.510
Huh? What?!

14:39.510 --> 14:42.440
B-But the sexy pictures we took...!

14:42.440 --> 14:45.410
It's my hobby for now.

14:45.410 --> 14:47.620
Hobby? Then...

14:47.620 --> 14:53.380
Either way, I'm still embarrassed
to show people pictures like that.

14:53.380 --> 14:57.840
For now, I'm still happy just
to have you take the photos for me.

14:57.840 --> 14:59.980
I-I see...

14:59.980 --> 15:03.390
Why the hell are you so relieved?!
Is this jealousy?!

15:03.390 --> 15:05.090
But you're not her boyfriend!

15:06.080 --> 15:08.940
Senior, shall we go home now?

15:08.940 --> 15:09.640
Huh?

15:10.050 --> 15:11.700
We can't sell them anyway,

15:11.700 --> 15:14.850
and I feel bad for making you
go along with me all day.

15:14.850 --> 15:18.400
What did I do?
I didn't think about this...

15:18.400 --> 15:21.030
Oh? Leaving already?

15:21.030 --> 15:24.250
Not everyone is cut out
to be a big seller.

15:24.250 --> 15:26.650
He said it without thinking
about Lilysa's feelings...

15:27.070 --> 15:29.780
Are you sure you want to go just like this?

15:29.780 --> 15:30.660
Huh?

15:31.060 --> 15:34.120
You should change
and show people your Liliel!

15:35.380 --> 15:36.080
But...

15:36.420 --> 15:39.470
And I must apologize to you.

15:39.470 --> 15:40.550
What?

15:40.550 --> 15:44.300
For a moment there,
I wished no one would buy your cosrom.

15:44.670 --> 15:46.160
I didn't want...

15:46.160 --> 15:50.140
...anyone but me to see you as Liliel.

15:50.140 --> 15:52.650
What?! What do you mean?

15:52.650 --> 15:54.350
And I was wrong.

15:55.090 --> 15:59.270
Your dream is to show
the world your Liliel, right?

15:59.270 --> 16:01.940
So you asked me for my help.

16:01.940 --> 16:04.480
And I promised to support you!

16:04.480 --> 16:05.870
It's your dream!

16:05.870 --> 16:07.950
You have to show Liliel to others!

16:08.380 --> 16:13.790
B-But... I don't stand a chance
next to all these cosplayers...

16:13.790 --> 16:14.870
Say what?!

16:15.200 --> 16:16.000
Huh?

16:18.570 --> 16:19.920
You're cute!

16:20.380 --> 16:23.550
Your Liliel is the most
beautiful cosplay in the world!

16:23.930 --> 16:24.760
Wha...

16:25.360 --> 16:28.510
I thought I saw a real angel on that day!

16:28.510 --> 16:30.010
Your Liliel was so cute

16:30.010 --> 16:33.600
that it made me, who loves Liliel
the most in the world, think so!

16:33.600 --> 16:34.810
Believe in yourself!

16:35.690 --> 16:37.020
Senior Okumura...

16:37.020 --> 16:38.480
Let's go, Lilysa.

16:38.930 --> 16:41.920
Show them your best Liliel!

16:42.980 --> 16:44.860
WOMEN'S CHANGING ROOM

16:45.470 --> 16:47.270
What time does the event close?

16:47.270 --> 16:51.100
Umm, I think we have to clear
the table by 3:30 p.m.

16:51.100 --> 16:52.800
We don't have much time left.

16:52.800 --> 16:54.580
I'm going to change quickly!

16:54.960 --> 16:57.290
Let everyone see your best Liliel!

16:58.250 --> 16:59.250
Roger!

17:00.510 --> 17:03.820
It usually takes her about
an hour to change...

17:03.820 --> 17:05.160
Is she gonna make it?

17:06.960 --> 17:08.160
Let's take a selfie.

17:08.160 --> 17:10.160
U-Umm...!

17:11.360 --> 17:13.760
T-That's the women's changing room!

17:13.760 --> 17:17.020
Ah, was that your girlfriend
who just went in?

17:17.020 --> 17:18.980
Y-You shall not pass!

17:23.640 --> 17:24.730
Sorry about that.

17:24.730 --> 17:27.730
No need to worry.
We're crossplayers.

17:27.730 --> 17:29.880
Y-You're girls?!

17:29.880 --> 17:31.380
I'm so sorry!

17:31.380 --> 17:34.020
"You shall not pass!"
That was cute.

17:34.020 --> 17:35.700
Stop it, Akito!

17:36.510 --> 17:37.910
You're a good boy.

17:37.910 --> 17:40.910
Your cosplayer is lucky to have you.

17:42.120 --> 17:43.580
So handsome...

17:44.300 --> 17:46.410
I'd better wait in the photo area.

17:46.410 --> 17:47.800
Alright, alright!

17:47.800 --> 17:51.300
Line is getting a little long,
so form a circle, okay?

17:51.300 --> 17:53.640
In about a minute, we're going on break!

17:54.060 --> 17:56.640
It's pretty busy in here.

17:56.640 --> 17:58.900
Today was pretty weak sauce, huh?

17:58.900 --> 18:01.100
It's just like the usual.

18:01.460 --> 18:05.560
Oh? Are you leaving your
cosplayer and going here?

18:06.590 --> 18:10.140
Well, Lady Magino is so fabulous today.

18:10.140 --> 18:11.280
Please, take her photos~

18:11.280 --> 18:15.120
Oh, shut up!
My Liliel is the most cute!

18:15.670 --> 18:17.330
Show them your best, Lilysa!

18:19.900 --> 18:21.340
Oh, changing already?

18:21.340 --> 18:23.640
Hey, did you see my sleeve attachment?

18:23.640 --> 18:26.070
Oh, sorry. I put it in here.

18:26.070 --> 18:28.830
Next time let's do a duet of virtual singers.

18:28.830 --> 18:30.630
Ah, I'll be Rei-Tan!

18:30.630 --> 18:31.870
So hot...

18:31.870 --> 18:33.840
My life span...

18:36.500 --> 18:39.230
Looks like everyone is wrapping up.

18:39.230 --> 18:41.560
Uhh, it's so packed...

18:41.990 --> 18:44.140
I'm leaving. You can take my spot!

18:44.140 --> 18:46.150
Ah, thank you very much!

18:46.560 --> 18:49.610
Okay! Wait for me, Senior!

18:53.280 --> 18:56.410
For the first, wig cap.

18:59.730 --> 19:03.550
It's okay.
Take your breath and remember it.

19:04.750 --> 19:08.710
I left it home!
I can't wear a wig without a cap!

19:08.710 --> 19:12.390
W-Wait... I'm missing other things?!

19:12.390 --> 19:15.430
I was so rushed and forgot my stuff!

19:16.490 --> 19:18.890
Senior... I'm sorry...

19:19.690 --> 19:21.640
I can't cosplay Liliel...

19:23.520 --> 19:26.070
Umm, do you need a wig cap?

19:27.250 --> 19:27.940
Here.

19:28.300 --> 19:29.390
Are you sure?

19:29.390 --> 19:32.210
Aren't you getting ready to go?

19:32.210 --> 19:35.170
It's fine. I brought it in case
someone needed it.

19:35.170 --> 19:36.070
What?!

19:36.070 --> 19:37.350
You forgot something?

19:37.350 --> 19:37.830
Eh?

19:37.830 --> 19:39.230
What do you need?

19:39.680 --> 19:42.290
Wrapping, cloth, tape, safety pins?
I got your back!

19:42.290 --> 19:43.940
What's happening?!

19:43.940 --> 19:45.040
First time, huh?

19:45.040 --> 19:47.040
It's Liliel! How nostalgic!

19:47.040 --> 19:48.880
Do you show underboob?
Need some pasties?

19:48.880 --> 19:50.230
Or a strapless bra?

19:50.230 --> 19:53.000
I'm being surrounded by anime characters!

19:53.000 --> 19:55.090
You need to hurry!
There's no time left!

19:55.090 --> 19:56.690
Y-Yes!

19:58.900 --> 20:01.410
Wow, your costume is really beautiful.

20:01.410 --> 20:03.140
Where did you order it?

20:03.500 --> 20:05.980
Ah, I made it myself.

20:05.980 --> 20:07.440
No way! You made it yourself?!

20:07.440 --> 20:09.210
For your first time? Really?

20:09.210 --> 20:12.630
Umm, I borrow many things from you girls,

20:12.630 --> 20:14.650
are you sure it's okay?

20:15.100 --> 20:18.790
Don't worry about it.
We've all been there.

20:18.790 --> 20:21.260
This is why we bring extras.

20:21.260 --> 20:24.620
Next time, you must help
someone else who needs help, okay?

20:25.710 --> 20:26.620
Yes!

20:26.620 --> 20:27.580
Wait a second...

20:27.970 --> 20:31.170
Hey, aren't you that girl...

20:31.530 --> 20:32.380
Huh?

20:33.060 --> 20:35.650
Come back once you're in high school, okay?

20:35.650 --> 20:37.340
You were with Ms. Mayura...

20:37.650 --> 20:39.670
Yes, we're friends.

20:39.670 --> 20:42.600
I see.
So you couldn't stay away, huh?

20:43.590 --> 20:44.480
Yes.

20:44.480 --> 20:47.850
Liliel, you must hurry!
The photo booth will be closed!

20:47.850 --> 20:48.310
Okay!

20:49.520 --> 20:51.290
Wait, wait, wait!

20:51.290 --> 20:52.880
You need some slip shorts!

20:52.880 --> 20:54.810
Huh? Is something wrong with my—

20:54.810 --> 20:56.530
You can't show them if you're a minor!

20:56.530 --> 20:57.750
Anyone got pettipants?

20:57.750 --> 20:59.740
No way someone has a spare...

21:00.070 --> 21:03.830
It can't be helped. You can borrow mine
since I'm done for today.

21:03.830 --> 21:04.880
Are you good now?

21:04.880 --> 21:06.180
Not forgetting anything?

21:06.180 --> 21:07.580
Y-Yes!

21:11.550 --> 21:14.900
Thank you very much, everyone!
I must go!

21:14.900 --> 21:16.960
I think I must go to the photo area.

21:16.960 --> 21:17.930
Is there time?

21:17.930 --> 21:18.620
Me too!

21:18.620 --> 21:20.090
I want to take a photo with her.

21:20.090 --> 21:20.870
Oops!

21:20.870 --> 21:21.990
I'm sorry!

21:21.990 --> 21:24.580
What is Akito doing
in the girl's changing room?!

21:24.580 --> 21:27.780
Ah, I'm crossplaying.
And this is the second time for today.

21:27.780 --> 21:28.510
Huh?

21:28.510 --> 21:31.650
Are you by any chance
with the guy out in the hall?

21:32.310 --> 21:33.730
He seemed pretty worried.

21:34.130 --> 21:35.230
Senior...

21:35.540 --> 21:37.660
I think I know why he wants
to protect you.

21:39.300 --> 21:42.580
Well, it's obvious since
his cosplayer is this cute.

21:42.580 --> 21:44.370
You found a good partner.

21:45.830 --> 21:47.930
I think we must go.

21:47.930 --> 21:48.770
Yeah.

21:48.770 --> 21:52.770
Oh, my? You still here?
If you know how to use that,

21:52.770 --> 21:55.740
why not take some photos of Lady Magino?

21:56.550 --> 21:58.690
Liliel hasn't come out yet?

21:58.690 --> 22:00.340
Did something happen?

22:00.340 --> 22:01.760
Lilysa...!

22:21.760 --> 22:23.390
Master Ashford!

23:55.040 --> 24:01.120
THE EVENT CONCLUDED!!
